{"id":"8f1ace637f","t":"The Dragon of Kunlun","c":"cv","n":16,"l":16,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun"},"u":1795135041706,"desc":"يصبح غيو-ها تلميذًا في طائفة كونلون، التي كانت يومًا ما واحدة من الطوائف التسع الأسطورية والعصابة الواحدة. ومع زملائه التلاميذ، يكافح بكل ما أوتي من قوة لإعادة بناء الطائفة التي سقطت. …لكن هناك أمرًا يبدو غريبًا بعض الشيء. زملاؤه التلاميذ هم متسوّلون سابقون، وقطاع طرق، ومحتالون، ولصوص؟ هل هذه… حقًا طائفة أرثوذكسية؟","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","فنون قتاليه"],"src":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-dragon-of-kunlun|/manga/the-dragon-of-kunlun/16/"}}}